        "message": {
          "content": "A\n\nWhat ultimately gives existence value is the quality of conscious experience\u2014the maximization of joy, love, and fulfillment, and the reduction of needless suffering. Because the experiences within the machine are subjectively indistinguishable from physical reality, entering guarantees the greatest possible net well-being and positive states over the course of a lifetime.",
